@startuml Sequence Diagram - Re-process Failed Document

actor "Admin" as Admin
participant "KnowledgeDocumentView" as DocView
participant "ClerkAuth" as ClerkAuth
participant "Backend" as Backend

Admin -> DocView : 1 Open documents list page
activate DocView
DocView -> DocView : 2 Display documents list

Admin -> DocView : 3 Select failed document
Admin -> DocView : 4 Click "Re-process" button

DocView -> ClerkAuth : 5 Send re-process request
activate ClerkAuth
ClerkAuth -> Backend : 6 Re-process document
activate Backend
Backend -> Backend : 7 Process document
Backend -> ClerkAuth : 8 Confirmation
ClerkAuth -> DocView : 9 Success notification
DocView -> Admin : 10 Display success message

deactivate Backend
deactivate ClerkAuth
deactivate DocView

@enduml
